  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.6 - fix client registration defaults and harden outbound HTTP resilience.\n\n            Changes:\n            - Make the three-argument client registration start successfully with its default scope\n            - Default combined System API client helpers to the required system_api scope\n            - Consolidate token retries into one transient-only policy that honors EnableHttpResilience\n            - Prevent automatic retries of System API mutation requests\n            - Dispose intermediate and terminal token responses correctly",
